		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3884187493BA916A"]
			description: [
				"GregTech's energy system, &9EU&r (Energy Units), works with &cVoltage&r (V) and &dAmperage&r (A). Power is transferred in packets: Voltage is the packet size, and Amperage is the packet count."
				""
				"Machines and cables have specific Voltage tier limits (LV, MV, HV) and Amperage ratings. Exceeding these causes explosions or fires. Progression involves stepping up voltage tiers with transformers and managing cable loss."
				""
				"Also, do not place your machines under the open sky; they will explode if it rains."
			]
			id: "310B08BB2DFC4D6F"
			shape: "circle"
			tasks: [{
				id: "49C153743ED07EE2"
				title: "How do they work?"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Stand on y=-63 in the Overworld to teleport to the Undergarden."
				""
				"To return, stand on y=121."
				""
				"Don't be afraid of falling or suffocating in walls; your magical presence protects you from instant death."
